  "note": "Hand-written, because the only Data Center available is production and recording it would bake real issue summaries and employee names into a committed file. The request shapes mirror the Cloud recording beside it, so the same test drives both and a divergence is the responses rather than the questions. What this proves is that a response is handled; only the Cloud half proves a request is accepted.",
